  "sreadya_publicTopic__dot__accessibility__dot__section2__dot__action": "Open worldwide settings",
  "sreadya_publicTopic__dot__accessibility__dot__section2__dot__body": "Choose metric/imperial units, 12/24-hour time and a BCP-47 formatting locale. RTL direction is applied for supported right-to-left locales while the reviewed message catalogue remains English.",
  "sreadya_publicTopic__dot__accessibility__dot__section2__dot__title": "Worldwide formatting",
  "sreadya_publicTopic__dot__accessibility__dot__section3__dot__action": "Install the PWA",
  "sreadya_publicTopic__dot__accessibility__dot__section3__dot__body": "The installable PWA keeps an offline application shell and the private navigation is designed for desktop, tablet and one-handed mobile layouts.",
